                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b68001cc-ee90-3f41-bc66-156f8c85cba9",
                        "entry_id": "76d35aa9-ff59-3437-9863-89225177a569",
                        "glosses": [
                            "basic research"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d905b129-2e96-47eb-916b-ceeebc439bd8",
                                "sense_id": "b68001cc-ee90-3f41-bc66-156f8c85cba9",
                                "text": "Die zunehmende Evidenz für Zusammenhänge zwischen Mikrobiota und Gesundheit und die sehr ermutigenden Ergebnisse zur Modulation der Darmmikrobiota durch Prä-/Probiotika rechtfertigen die Fortsetzung der Grundlagenforschung und klinischer Studien in diesem Bereich, um zu ermitteln, welche Prä-/Probiotika in welcher Dosierung und für welche Indikationen am besten geeignet sind.",
                                "translation": "The increased evidence for relationships between microbiota and health and the very encouraging results on gut microbiota modulation by pre/probiotics justify going on with basic research and clinical trials in this field to determine the best pre/probiotics to be used, at what doses, and for which indications.",
                                "english": "The increased evidence for relationships between microbiota and health and the very encouraging results on gut microbiota modulation by pre/probiotics justify going on with basic research and clinical trials in this field to determine the best pre/probiotics to be used, at what doses, and for which indications."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
